Package: alpinejs
Title: Lightweight Reactive HTML User Interfaces with 'Alpine.js'
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Andrew", "Brown", , "brown.andrewg@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-4565-533X"))
Maintainer: Andrew Brown <brown.andrewg@gmail.com>
Description: Compose interactive JavaScript applications entirely in R using
    'Alpine.js'. Write component state, event handlers, and logic as R code.
    The package generates the HTML and Alpine.js directives. All interactivity
    runs client-side with no server dependency. Features reactive data binding,
    R-to-JSON serialization with type preservation, a plugin system, and
    pre-built components for accordions, modals, tabs, and forms.
